    {
      "id": "80542aa3e383c544878638ec412c5b5e5b4ec61205119fbbdb7ade1cbb6dc06d",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e26b729cd4bcb99fe1db9301011924068255f7b8710da0dc7127bc70fcb7ec4",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f0afdf3bab4a573bd05e58a72f5bc48bfae83654f922dd228f5e1b2fdae9c40",
      "text": "Memory and Steering",
      "hash": "e9396c915a0fb1c9f188708920573d4a5b1ec0a09639049682989999ecbdf3de"
    },
    {
      "id": "f808f548a154b4c8edbaf44bff86133efbd4490b9c592845d104377690fb4573",
      "text": "Memory system",
      "hash": "0262e82db5dfb849a70a2a6a94c1afd575205f2d24d5f001afa96f4d8dcb47d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a601f7941a19f8b8504bc641108ee99d1ca84b613ff068cce8b99298944dfa6a",
      "text": "A system that attempts to make an agent stateful across sessions by persisting to the environment and reloading at session start.",
      "hash": "0da6aa86553264fd3252a69391b29d866ec079baa42e4c0ddef78b7e7834f6eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c96b54d54338bc7f408370b4fd263a2a87034838dbb2a94b0d96e2db7eb5b76",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7d0633cc87b8f74696e7e610ef3f4891e491670ec1be15cf2c65b8fb514fa18",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "701797f927bf47a1bbb0c2b4421b97ae6a45d9d8206757df05face78e8e710ee",
      "text": "A system that attempts to make an",
      "hash": "4e3948baf79c38a8975c3e0958d87b7ee79e683f91e72e729f1c2d68269e580e"
    },
    {
      "id": "898a2a1d27e51b479c2fe26d727a6b79a0ad7b71f3d660d376676f628b638996",
      "text": ". Persists information into the",
      "hash": "0815d4fd241b72eb65c47509efb358f5f31b3a13ade054bd5b620e146a5c9ffd"
    },
    {
      "id": "9870d6dde220fb07f6cf9898588ee8f120f0b503fe47ca39cfa6e6f283df3e34",
      "text": "during a session and reloads it into the",
      "hash": "4af303fc82bf74127810cb0d8270d4b206bd4c2ce1ede94e5f6da40f51bf058d"
    },
    {
      "id": "08b0bb3069f2096234f0ad2df97aeadd6543e65ee6d3903d44d58a9e07c9b8ba",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "d32fc24b64e31622ab6f111d717c78dae39ba0370ef23520db204fbc4fc73461",
      "text": "at the start of future ones, so the agent carries continuity beyond the user",
      "hash": "6104ac897bd70e3f85978acbe99740792529474030cd1e0aa6f89bd94f67c3a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e34cfd010fc4b37c8b6e2a1176236d124fe817945c53b8ff47a17a71fc65395",
      "text": "the session.",
      "hash": "4ddb3e02f10efe5a7468169e0810d21976b194c83f16aae5b93c5fe4fbcc4495"
    },
    {
      "id": "a61324802ad972cfd2f1b08efe1c82ecb248dc210ecc72b2d6de43f7d92a4cce",
      "text": "A memory system has two halves. The write path: during a session, the agent records what it learned — a preference you stated, a fact about the project — as files in the environment. The read path: at session start, the",
      "hash": "d29dbf8640895a3c8f510440b025bbd5599fe2f938e994e5e23f9e0b036dae7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "feb0047f2764afcb0e2327881966a0995eadd0a5f2d6eae9ec49f096b1959da3",
      "text": "loads those files, or an index of them, back into the context window. Many harnesses ship their own memory system — Claude Code's",
      "hash": "544f5f0be171a953f1ea64af32f25ec31622801f0c721d23d4c104841f1798cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "aee4e0e8e7301e4d0f814db4d3519c3bb5b583738fd2013659543872dab850c0",
      "text": "is one — but you can also build one yourself: a directory of notes plus an instruction in",
      "hash": "c8becb680294d53495db41b267d80981d0a700eca4449395b44cd98dc613c10b"
    },
    {
      "id": "95e54d37ec381f2687dc3467858826a94d5c280152242af6509532db73486966",
      "text": "to consult it.",
      "hash": "e7ad44b0357316ad00c7d84f96cef820a3bc2ccf27ef105878f416bcee42bc7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "e678af9dd488bb31dec4d75f7191af5df3c290b3d1f26462ea7579d8cd175084",
      "text": "The same trade-offs as any always-loaded content apply. Memories accumulate, so most systems load a one-line index and leave the bodies behind",
      "hash": "8282964751c0ea8ea4d6afde37519b0b39eeb610e4b1afaa5ec16230f13bffb4"
    },
    {
      "id": "655a1a8be2ca47b9fce0dec1ba2359baa6f14824b8a8cb82eac5ec63e461ccc5",
      "text": "context pointers",
      "hash": "82528bbf7c9c348f2db59980c707a48c7c85c4ea3d7f7f63f107a209445930c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8fc2eb2949c50a2dbb02a69f476709c43738f0ddf75fb382c5d23a32741ddc8",
      "text": "rather than inlining everything. And memories are",
      "hash": "506e79681f4796857e57bb3d626f5df43813f86b74e7eef5930a4dbafcd1e5e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "4cb396198317655bb7458f18f29ceb0f4fc45345a9c85181210a1a636088a432",
      "text": "secondary sources",
      "hash": "1d16243e15ba0bee2085aec99e4b25d95dcef3906bfe8a42ed5a1f94a8aa04e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a30ddaddb7bb3e6ef5789c25e1d046e18b584e71f93f5634ae3902dd2f8c26df",
      "text": ", so they drift: a fact recorded in March is loaded with equal confidence in June, after the project has moved on. A memory system needs pruning, the same way AGENTS.md does.",
      "hash": "31a07588191c726ef70e56fbcaca0c65452917e7422c05f6330d0ba0d1808a85"
    },
    {
      "id": "8305ef1bb01e2d9293e465ceb46d8639277a0afa4a9dddfe74a13c4691f8011f",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa81775d17e43f60443ac6ab44109eb07fd91980949f0b450bd5b5e55aad5e51",
      "text": "\"I keep having to re-tell it I'm on Postgres, not MySQL.\"",
      "hash": "fe3a14fc85bd060b010210e5b35119aff9f4db0d6f635513545ef314071d1be8"
    },
    {
      "id": "456ec29e15772ffc6d2c5996a16e2e0ed87fef0bade14385794893c0b66cd9b4",
      "text": "\"Wire up a memory system — write what it learns to the",
      "hash": "c9978bf583cba5931878f1ffa76a58861923b78b72f1f75177c1b9010bfd7809"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fbf13ed79a421a85ce87914df0d60c18416f23cdaa275035e267f19340a7e0f",
      "text": "on the first",
      "hash": "5f0b3eae178d568aa0b27d35493f85175bfda2e2bf3de11f7546722b3d08e333"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6647307dddfc00e5684fa9c5dbdfe533f657fc8ef52b887eadbc4d1cfc54fef",
      "text": ", reload it at session start. The",
      "hash": "a2a3c54d6ccfff84cedff5468d760d0610bf0cb31122c3e0e99991f3bf88226c"
    },
    {
      "id": "f34274fad184675d54215a787dae3c6e33af93bd05492d96183af86ca5c73552",
      "text": "itself is",
      "hash": "c47154caa3f8bb09360c30c795c23d5d391e450c21843d0e602e7e857c85daee"
    },
    {
      "id": "75fc4f7121e8bf3898101621118a0fef0548fbe43a0854317a629e844d396254",
      "text": "; the memory layer fakes continuity.\"",
      "hash": "2dff34cddeb1f20632b82ba7dea1c7fc5b51fb38c5e883ec25f9009761f94ba5"
    },
    {
      "id": "61646326f77a3ec09221cd0f599e06cb77144a65650bc5786cbd3474cb0bba7c",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e249544dd4eca1364e523ff520876e7be90e4918b8c27ec49ddd7f22b1082e7",
      "text": "Autocompact",
      "hash": "8a36ad552d898798dd978db0b1b2d4e568ae7f3c3b3295eedb4df69ab8604e0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "60dfc4dc7fcce50166e2113fcba19dd585408cc343ac3693565d59ad7700f5b4",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "b826777aa14f34f802723a99f3a2b7a00b1d910ed64ae54531172a5fe75f7d7f",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
